Package: boswas-branding
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: breeze-icon-theme, fonts-lato, plasma-workspace, sddm-theme-breeze
Description: Boswas OS visual identity for KDE Plasma
 The Boswas OS visual identity for the desktop, built from the Boswas OS
 logo (the gold and silver "b" mark) and the brand typeface:
 .
  * Orbitron, the brand typeface (SIL Open Font License 1.1)
  * "Boswas" Plasma Global Theme (look-and-feel) and default desktop layout
  * "Boswas Dark" colour scheme with the logo's gold as the accent
  * Boswas wallpaper, login (SDDM) and lock screen backgrounds
  * Boswas launcher icon and System Settings "About this System" branding
  * screen lock policy (automatic lock after 10 minutes, enforced)
 .
 Defaults are delivered through an XDG configuration directory
 (/usr/share/boswas/kde-settings), so /etc/xdg and per-user settings keep
 precedence and no file of another package is modified.
